#: ../../language/attributes/intrinsic.md:1
msgid "Intrinsic Attribute"
msgstr "内建指令属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/intrinsic.md:3
msgid ""
"`#intrinsic(\"name\")` associates a function with a compiler intrinsic "
"while retaining an ordinary function body."
msgstr "`#intrinsic(\"name\")` 将函数与编译器内建指令关联，同时保留普通函数体。"

#: ../../language/attributes/intrinsic.md:7
msgid ""
"Intrinsics are not a stable API. They may change without notice and are "
"not recommended for application code. Prefer ordinary functions and "
"public standard-library APIs."
msgstr "内建指令不是稳定的 API，可能在不通知的情况下发生变化，不建议在应用代码中使用。请优先使用普通函数和标准库公开的 API。"

#: ../../language/attributes/intrinsic.md:12
msgid ""
"If the compiler does not recognize the name, it reports "
"[E0094](/language/error_codes/E0094.md), ignores the attribute, and uses "
"the ordinary function body. This is different from a direct intrinsic "
"declaration (`fn f(x : Int32) -> Int32 = \"name\"`), which has no "
"ordinary body and reports [E4070](/language/error_codes/E4070.md) for an "
"unknown name."
msgstr "如果编译器无法识别该名称，它会报告 [E0094](/language/error_codes/E0094.md)，忽略属性并使用普通函数体。这与直接声明内建指令（`fn f(x : Int32) -> Int32 = \"name\"`）不同：后者没有普通函数体，遇到未知名称时会报告 [E4070](/language/error_codes/E4070.md)。"

#: ../../language/attributes/intrinsic.md:18
msgid ""
"Specifying multiple intrinsics for one function is not supported; see "
"[E4071](/language/error_codes/E4071.md)."
msgstr "不支持为同一个函数指定多个内建指令，参见 [E4071](/language/error_codes/E4071.md)。"
